# Flutter/Dart state from a local build of web/.
#
# .dart_tool is the important one, and leaving it out is a correctness fix rather than a
# size optimisation: package_config.json inside it records *absolute* paths to the SDK and the pub
# cache on whichever machine ran `flutter pub get`. Copied into the image it overwrites the one the
# build stage just generated, and dart2js then fails trying to read
# /Users/<someone>/.pub-cache/... — which is a confusing way to find out that a host artefact
# leaked into a container.
web/.dart_tool/
web/build/
web/.flutter-plugins
web/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
web/*.iml
